# Sonic Frontiers (PPSA03831) -- isolated first boot to playable Cyber Space (w6d01).
#
# Recorded from the owner's controller on 2026-10-10, then replayed in a visible full-cadence
# prosper-app with isolated PROSPER_SAVE0 and PROSPER_SAVEDATA_DIR directories. The replay opened
# ui_gamemodestage and 194 w6d01_trr asset records; its F9 capture shows the stage HUD and timer.
# World rendering remains incomplete. This route verifies navigation, not visual correctness.
#
# Anchors are DISPLAY FLIPS ('f'), not seconds or pad reads. The recorded brief presses preserve
# the release between menu actions. After the last interval, input is neutral: continuing to
# spam Cross/Options after the notices can enter Settings instead of starting a game.
#
# f445-f1030: Recorded confirms clear the initial notices and reach the main menu.
# f1063-f1083: Five separate Up presses move from Extras to New Game.
# f1090-f1164: Confirms enter New Game and answer its prompts.
# f1219-f1328: Recorded holds dismiss the opening; the owner reached controllable Sonic and
#             captured gameplay at guest present 1436. A subsequent automatic replay also
#             reached the stage and captured its HUD, with no worker fault.
#
# Use fresh private save directories for every comparison arm; inherited saves select a
# different notice/menu route. Budget at least five minutes for a visible 4K renderer run.

